    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d153-a9-a1-a5">

                <pb facs="0317" n="971" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg971"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Apodaca</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-08-15"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 15,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Let it be obeyed. Consequently the witnesses who may be presented by Don Toribio
                    Lozano, the party interested in this case, having been examined, let their
                    testimony be transmitted to this court, as ordered above. I, Feliciano T. Garza,
                    second alcade, so determine, order, and sign, with assisting witnesses,
                    according to law. I certify.</p>
                <closer><signed>FELICIANO T. GARZA.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hesiquio Garza</hi>,</p>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Antonio de la Garza y Garza</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Assisting Witnesses.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
